  "command": "sed",
  "help": "Usage: sed [-nE] [-e SCRIPT] [-f SCRIPTFILE] [SCRIPT] [FILE...]\n{{help:help:0}}\n{{help:version:0}}\nStream editor: p/d/q/=, s/RE/REPLACEMENT/[gNp], h/H/g/G/x, :/b/t/T, groups, n/N/P/D/a/i/c.\nAddresses: line number, $, /RE/, ranges and !. BRE default; -E enables ERE.\nBRE/ERE supports pattern backreferences and word assertions.\nIn-place editing and locale-aware matching are not supported.\nProject alias: --extended selects -r/-E; the GNU long name is --regexp-extended.\n",
  "catalog_options": [
